      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY BARBIE GIRL (1) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (30.10) at Wentworth Park over 520m. Won at her only start from this draw. Good form should continue. WINSOME WAY (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.36) at this track behind Iona Huntrix in a Mix. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can measure up. SEE NO GRIEF (2) last start finished 4th in a Mix on September 9 over 520m at this track behind Wolfman Sid beaten 12 lengths (30.72). Suited here and expected to run well. ANT BITE (4) did a good job to finish third last time out over 520m at this track (30.70) in a Mix, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
